        {
            "id": "https://www.jujubemonster.com/widening-circles.html",
            "url": "https://www.jujubemonster.com/widening-circles.html",
            "title": "Widening Circles",
            "summary": "I live my life in widening circles that reach out across the world. I may not complete this last one, but I give myself to it. I have been circling around God, around the ancient tower, and I have been circling for a thousand years.",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"795s6\" data-offset-key=\"bv5v0-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"bv5v0-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"bv5v0-0-0\">I live my life in widening circles</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"795s6\" data-offset-key=\"2j499-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"2j499-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"2j499-0-0\">that reach out across the world.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"795s6\" data-offset-key=\"chd30-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"chd30-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"chd30-0-0\">I may not complete this last one,</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"795s6\" data-offset-key=\"5rrsv-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"5rrsv-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"5rrsv-0-0\">but I give myself to it.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"795s6\" data-offset-key=\"fbu9s-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"fbu9s-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"fbu9s-0-0\">I have been circling around God, around the ancient tower,</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"795s6\" data-offset-key=\"doejr-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"doejr-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"doejr-0-0\">and I have been circling for a thousand years.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"795s6\" data-offset-key=\"b092m-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"b092m-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"b092m-0-0\">And I still don't know:</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"795s6\" data-offset-key=\"31ds2-0-0\">\n<div class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\" data-offset-key=\"31ds2-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"31ds2-0-0\">am I a falcon, a storm, or a great song?</span></div>\n<div data-offset-key=\"31ds2-0-0\">-- Rainer Maria Rilke</div>\n<div data-offset-key=\"31ds2-0-0\"> </div>\n<div data-offset-key=\"31ds2-0-0\"><figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/121/nosleep.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"664\"></figure></div>\n</div>",
            "image": "https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/121/nosleep-2.png",
